## usable SHA equals the local tracking tip
main  is in sync with local tracking ref  origin/main .  origin/main  matched the remote when checked 2 min ago.

## usable SHA differs from the local tracking tip
main  is in sync with local tracking ref  origin/main .  origin/main  differs from the remote head observed 2 min ago; run git fetch origin to update local tracking refs.

## usable answer reports absence
main  is in sync with local tracking ref  origin/main .  main  was absent on origin when checked 2 min ago.

## miss
main  is in sync with local tracking ref  origin/main . Remote state has not been verified.

## unusable answer (another branch)
main  is in sync with local tracking ref  origin/main . Remote state has not been verified.

## usable SHA, no local tracking tip
No local tracking ref  origin/main ; the remote branch was present when checked 2 min ago.
